    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674500/extras/4461fcaa934b1a93f0464a8dcd62be73.avif?t=1698966495\" width=600 height=101 /></span><br>Taisho Taxi Service invites you to embark on a heart-pounding retro horror adventure in the hauntingly atmospheric streets of rural Japan. <br>Inspired by classic horror titles, this open-world game with a linear narrative combines spine-tingling suspense with chilling encounters.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674500/extras/dbc556de00091cc397c83d6a24dd3879.avif?t=1698966495\" width=600 height=101 /></span><br>As a rookie taxi driver in a town where outsiders are unwelcome, you'll uncover a sinister web of secrets and a narrative that keeps you on the edge of your seat. <br>You'll have to juggle driving to the requested location, checking your map, watching out for cars and most importantly, the most unstable of them all, your passengers. Don't keep your eyes off them for a second!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674500/extras/2496171d77e3393b14a378ff08d44691.poster.avif?t=1698966495\" width=720 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674500/extras/2496171d77e3393b14a378ff08d44691.webm?t=1698966495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674500/extras/2496171d77e3393b14a378ff08d44691.mp4?t=1698966495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Can you navigate the eerie streets and make the right choices to survive, or will you become the next victim in a town that thrives on darkness? Clock in on your first shift and experience the horrors that lurk within Taisho Taxi Service.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674500/extras/4461fcaa934b1a93f0464a8dcd62be73.avif?t=1698966495\" width=600 height=101 /></span><br>Taisho Taxi Service invites you to embark on a heart-pounding retro horror adventure in the hauntingly atmospheric streets of rural Japan. <br>Inspired by classic horror titles, this open-world game with a linear narrative combines spine-tingling suspense with chilling encounters.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674500/extras/dbc556de00091cc397c83d6a24dd3879.avif?t=1698966495\" width=600 height=101 /></span><br>As a rookie taxi driver in a town where outsiders are unwelcome, you'll uncover a sinister web of secrets and a narrative that keeps you on the edge of your seat. <br>You'll have to juggle driving to the requested location, checking your map, watching out for cars and most importantly, the most unstable of them all, your passengers. Don't keep your eyes off them for a second!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674500/extras/2496171d77e3393b14a378ff08d44691.poster.avif?t=1698966495\" width=720 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674500/extras/2496171d77e3393b14a378ff08d44691.webm?t=1698966495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2674500/extras/2496171d77e3393b14a378ff08d44691.mp4?t=1698966495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Can you navigate the eerie streets and make the right choices to survive, or will you become the next victim in a town that thrives on darkness? Clock in on your first shift and experience the horrors that lurk within Taisho Taxi Service.",
    "short_description": "Experience a first-person retro horror journey in rural Japan. Navigate in your taxi, picking up sketchy passengers, while vigilantly monitoring your map, rear-view mirror, and the treacherous road. Confront your deepest fears in this open-world nightmare where survival is far from certain.",
